After the office, I go to a clothing shop.
The shop is large and bright.
A young man is there.
He is the shopkeeper.
I say to him, "Hello, brother."
The shopkeeper smiles.
He says, "Hello madam, welcome."
"What do you need?"
I say, "Now it is the month of March."
"There is a lot of heat in Mumbai."
"In the heat, I wear light cotton clothes."
"Do you have light clothes?"
The shopkeeper says, "Yes, I have excellent clothes."
"Look here, this is a small garment."
"There is also a large garment there."
I look at those clothes.
They are very beautiful.
I take those clothes.
